\title{stackcallr: Statically Inspect and Visualize the Call Tree of a Function}
\description{
Builds the call tree of a function from its source code, without running it. Given a function name, the function's body is parsed to find every function it calls, and those calls are followed recursively, resolving 'UseMethod()' dispatch into the registered S3 methods. The resulting tree is printed as an indented outline.
